          "date": "2026-06-10 21:37:22.000000000",
          "tz": -240
        },
        "subject": "LU-20352 lnet: better error reporting for md",
        "message": "LU-20352 lnet: better error reporting for md\n\nAdd CERROR() messages to the validation failure paths in\nlnet_md_build() so that an -EINVAL return can be traced\nback to the specific check that rejected the MD: a kiov\nentry extending past PAGE_SIZE, and an illegal max_size\nin both the kiov and contiguous cases. Previously, these\npaths returned -EINVAL with no indication of which check\nfailed.\n\nTest-Parameters: trivial\nSigned-off-by: Timothy Day <timday@thelustrecollective.com>\nChange-Id: I837220c479f8d051ae710e782b5642f87f0cffc7\n"
      },
      "branch": "refs/heads/master"
    }
